WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.507
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is The Plan B Switch.

00:00:13.507 --> 00:00:19.015
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:19.015 --> 00:00:22.319
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:22.319 --> 00:00:25.624
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:25.624 --> 00:00:33.334
Plans are wonderful. And sometimes, a plan breaks. Rain on field day. A door that is closed. A trip that gets changed.

00:00:33.334 --> 00:00:42.146
When that happens, there is a bump of a feeling. It has a name: disappointment.

00:00:42.146 --> 00:00:52.060
Disappointment is allowed here. We are not going to rush past it, and nobody has to argue it away.

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:56.466
For a broken plan, there is a switch. It has three moves. Let me show you.

00:00:56.466 --> 00:01:06.379
Move one: feel the bump. Say it plainly, even just inside: "I am disappointed. I really wanted that."

00:01:06.379 --> 00:01:16.293
Move two: name what stayed the same. The friends are still here. The day is still here. You are still you.

00:01:16.293 --> 00:01:26.206
Move three: pick the next true thing. Not the same thing — the next true thing. That is Plan B.

00:01:26.206 --> 00:01:35.018
Plan B does not have to pretend to be Plan A. It can be smaller, or different, or quieter.

00:01:35.018 --> 00:01:36.120
Both things can be true at once: you can miss Plan A, and still step into Plan B.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:46.033
Sometimes Plan B turns out lovely. Sometimes it is just… okay. We do not have to call it just as good when it is not.

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:55.947
Plan B is not a prize for being cheerful. It is simply the next true thing, and true things are solid ground.

00:01:55.947 --> 00:02:03.657
And the disappointment? It fades in its own time. Feelings move when they are allowed to be felt.

00:02:03.657 --> 00:02:04.759
You do not have to be glad the plan changed. You only have to find the next true thing.

00:02:04.759 --> 00:02:12.469
Feel the bump. Name what stayed the same. Pick the next true thing.

00:02:12.469 --> 00:02:17.977
Shoulders soft. Let your body rest.

00:02:17.977 --> 00:02:22.383
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:22.383 --> 00:02:27.890
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:33.398
You're ready for what's next.
